<title>JAPAN: Kioritz - 95/96 group results.</title>
<headline>Kioritz - 95/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to November 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 47.09		vs	   43.55</p>
<p> Operating   prft 277 million	 vs   loss 119 million</p>
<p> Current     prft 432 million	 vs   loss 127 million</p>
